  "decisions": [
    "Keep existing registry IDs. Replace the HU three-way splitter with native BasicMachine/LargeRecipeMachine, CU spec, actual CryoDistillationTower recipe map, rotation/tools/menu and inherited covers.",
    "Share original80-cell source geometry with normal tower and both JEI/EMI previews. Old cryo_distillation_wall remains registered but is not relabeled as original18102.",
    "Delete only same-input legacy three-product air rows from each native chemistry loader, allowing existing generated canonical six-product rows to resolve.",
    "Fluid output follows original onTick2 order before work, including unpowered, stopped or currently unformed controllers with saved outputs. Send each species three blocks behind main, at its source height.",
    "Only subtract actual receiver acceptance. Item output uses the bottom rear inventory, not adjacent main faces or items dropped into air.",
    "Old port-native gt.input and three gt.outputN compounds migrate verbatim; false HU buffer and false progress are not converted into CU, completed recipes or invented products."
  ],
  "remaining_boundaries": [
    "Old hollow five-layer cryo towers need rebuilding to the canonical solid eight-layer tower plus transmitter base.",
    "Source nine adjacent toggleable energy providers below the base remain pending: native manual enable and adjacent state need distinct controls; generic setEnabled is not an exact substitute.",
    "Source design1 backside-hole part overlays and complete cover/face transfer protocol remain separate gaps.",
    "Original input-tank source capacity/parallel multiplier, mutable saved machine configuration and full source overcharge behavior are not claimed complete.",
    "Natural CU production/full survival, player tooltip hover, ordinary installed distribution, independent saved-world restart, historical saves and ordinary dedicated server are not verified by this batch.",
    "All remaining block-specific tooltip/material families continue under the active goal."
  ]
